	(text_box "BUS (green): lit whenever\nthe transceivers have\npower."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 361.95 58.42 0)
		(size 24.13 7.62)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6b4bfbc0-90cc-1d5f-9715-5d746282d821")
	)
	(text_box "10 k defaults.\nWith the RP2354A\nin reset or\nblank, DC high\n(device) and TE\nlow (listen): the\ntransceivers\ncannot drive ATN,\nREN, IFC or DIO\nwhile the 5 V\nswitch opens."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.07 123.19 0)
		(size 17.78 21.59)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6fc9964d-c9b7-951c-2468-851ca69c537d")
	)
	(text_box "Core regulator (1.1 V): Raspberry Pi's parts\nand layout, copied exactly\n(gen/rpi_minimal). L1 is polarity-marked:\nits dot must sit as their footprint shows."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 35.56 0)
		(size 39.37 10.16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7143e86c-86f4-fb4c-8357-48fcaa00bf50")
	)
	(text_box "U2, SN75160B, carries\nDIO1-8. TE high drives\nthem onto the bus; PE\nhigh makes its drivers\ntotem-pole, low open-\ncollector (needed for\nparallel poll)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 382.27 121.92 0)
		(size 22.86 15.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d9e1345-3a80-5f99-23bf-4aca04a8776c")
	)
	(text_box "USB (yellow) and ERR (red) are the\nfirmware's. Both are low-voltage\ncolours, so a 3.3 V pin lights them\nthrough 330 R (3 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 205.74 0)
		(size 33.02 10.16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7de11a69-390b-0883-63a7-268ad19e53ba")
	)
	(text_box "3.3 V and 1.1 V: one 100 nF for every supply\npin. On the board each sits at its pin,\nexcept where the pin is walled in by signal\nlines (pins 6, 11, 20, 23): those join it\nthrough the supply rings under the chip."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 35.56 0)
		(size 40.64 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "af1f92f1-6fef-e6ad-eb4c-c8b984e627c0")
	)
	(text_box "USB 2.0 full speed, 12 Mbit/s. 27 R at\nthe chip (RP2350 datasheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.98 91.44 0)
		(size 35.56 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b2d4279a-08e3-df47-c392-0548fb29d4d4")
	)
	(text_box "XC6206: 3.3 V, 200 mA, for the\nRP2354A only (about 50 mA).\nDropout 0.25 V at 100 mA: a USB\nport sagging to 4.4 V still gives\n3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 69.85 35.56 0)
		(size 31.75 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bdb548b2-a2af-eace-125d-7a409f04a1fe")
	)
	(text_box "Direction: the\nfirmware sets TE\nhigh before it\ndrives a line,\nand stops driving\nbefore it sets TE\nlow, in one\nplace. The\ntransceivers'\nterminal outputs\nare short-circuit\nlimited (15-75\nmA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.07 229.87 0)
		(size 17.78 25.4)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cf486526-780a-41c6-3afc-11769e3a939a")
	)
	(text_box "UART0 console, 115200 baud: the\nDebug Probe's 'U' cable. Works\nwhen USB does not."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 207.01 0)
		(size 30.48 7.62)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d252d826-5192-5046-99a3-65a583356fd4")
	)
	(text_box "BOOT: hold it while plugging in to start\nthe RP2354A's USB bootloader. Rarely\nneeded: 'picotool reboot -f -u' gets\nthere from software. RUN stays open: it\nhas its own pull-up inside the RP2354A\n(datasheet table 1677), and the Debug\nProbe resets the chip over SWD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 163.83 0)
		(size 36.83 15.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d285ecfb-0738-aac0-b213-c50cfdc57162")
	)
	(text_box "U3, SN75161B, carries\nthe control lines. DC\nlow = system\ncontroller (drives\nATN, REN, IFC; listens\nto SRQ). TE high =\ntalker (drives DAV,\nEOI); low = listener\n(drives NRFD, NDAC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 382.27 173.99 0)
		(size 21.59 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e9d778e5-53b3-2f6b-649b-a257cefb3609")
	)
	(text_box "Raspberry Pi debug connector (JST-\nSH 3-pin): the Debug Probe's 'D'\ncable. 100 R on the target side,\nat the connector (the spec: at the\nchip). 3.3 V logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 148.59 0)
		(size 33.02 11.43)
